Z||000000||TRiAD||07-24-2001||10:08 AM||||hehe, got GT3 the day it came out, and have probably been putting too much time into it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Anyways, I completed the Rally Events section yesterday and won the Escudo! The car has over 900HP, just like in the old game, BUT...you can MODIFY the RACE CARS in this game! My FTO LM has over 900HP, my CLK DTM has like 600HP, and...<P>The Escudo now has OVER 1800HP! Woooohooooooo!<P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
