Z||000005||LZeitgeist||07-24-2001||01:01 PM||||Well, yeah, you'd *have* to be rich to be able to afford an 1800HP engine, but would that be possible to do and still have the car look stock from the outside? Like a 'sleeper from Hell' with the only visible things being like custom exhaust tips or something like that?<P>Or would that figure only be obtainable with things like through-the-hood-mounted superchargers and such?<P>Not that this is anything but a fun mental exercise... but what kind of regular production car might one start with to achieve an 1800HP sleeper? And what kind of engine and mods would be necessary to achieve this goal?||||reg||1
